        <UserObject id="e2e-a-wedged-guest-4-l" label="&lt;b&gt;3.4&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="&lt;b&gt;3.4 A guest that does not answer: step 4 record&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Keep the PNG as the result; reset or roll back only with approval.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;From:&lt;/b&gt; Agent session&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;To:&lt;/b&gt; Operator&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Via:&lt;/b&gt; manual&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Earlier in Agent session (no arrow):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;3.3 wait:&lt;/b&gt; Guest is up; retry exec with a deadline until Tools answer.&lt;/div&gt;" tags="flow-wedged-guest family-triage step-arrow"><mxCell style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#a0522d;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacing=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="e2e-L-triage"><mxGeometry x="131" y="835" width="38" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
